        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Guy Ritchie, Jason Statham, Ray Liotta, Vincent Pastore, André Benjamin, Kamay Lau, John August, Vanessa Taylor\n- Films: Revolver, Aladdin\n- Companies: Walt Disney Pictures, Lin Pictures, Marc Platt Productions\n- Topics: acting, directing, screenwriting, film production\n\nFacts:\n- Jason Statham was born on 26 July 1967.\n- Jason Statham is an English actor and a former model and competitive diver.\n- Revolver is a 2005 British-French crime thriller film.\n- Guy Ritchie co-wrote and directed Revolver.\n- Jason Statham, Ray Liotta, Vincent Pastore, and André Benjamin starred in Revolver.\n- Kamay Lau is a British actress best known as the failed hitlady in Revolver.\n- Aladdin is an upcoming American musical romantic fantasy film.\n- Guy Ritchie directed Aladdin from a screenplay by John August, Guy Ritchie, and Vanessa Taylor.\n- Walt Disney Pictures, Lin Pictures, and Marc Platt Productions co-produced Aladdin.",
